---
// SocialProof: Battle-tested in real supermarkets and retail chains
---

<section id="casos" class="py-20 lg:py-28 bg-surface-container-lowest border-t border-outline-variant/15 transition-colors duration-200">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <!-- Header -->
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-brand-mint/10 border border-brand-mint/20 text-brand-mint text-xs font-headline font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-4">
        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]">verified</span>
        Validación Operativa
      </div>
      <h2 class="font-headline text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-on-surface tracking-tight">
        Probado en el campo de batalla, no en un laboratorio
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-base sm:text-lg text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
        Comercios de alto volumen que atienden miles de clientes todos los días confían en InteliMarket para blindar su operación.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- 4 Big Stats -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6 mb-16">
      <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-surface-container border border-outline-variant/20 text-center">
        <span class="font-headline text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-brand-mint block mb-1">
          +250.000
        </span>
        <span class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold text-on-surface block">Tickets Mensuales</span>
        <span class="text-[11px] text-on-surface-variant">Procesados con cero pérdida de datos</span>
      </div>

      <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-surface-container border border-outline-variant/20 text-center">
        <span class="font-headline text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-brand-blue block mb-1">
          0 seg
        </span>
        <span class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold text-on-surface block">Cortes de Venta</span>
        <span class="text-[11px] text-on-surface-variant">Operatividad 100% offline-first</span>
      </div>

      <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-surface-container border border-outline-variant/20 text-center">
        <span class="font-headline text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-tertiary block mb-1">
          3 Divisas
        </span>
        <span class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold text-on-surface block">PYG • BRL • USD</span>
        <span class="text-[11px] text-on-surface-variant">Sin mezclas ni desfasajes cambiarios</span>
      </div>

      <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-surface-container border border-outline-variant/20 text-center">
        <span class="font-headline text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-amber-400 block mb-1">
          &lt; 15 min
        </span>
        <span class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold text-on-surface block">Inducción de Cajeras</span>
        <span class="text-[11px] text-on-surface-variant">Interfaz moderna e intuitiva</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Featured Case Study Card -->
    <div class="rounded-2xl bg-surface-container p-8 sm:p-12 border border-outline-variant/30 relative overflow-hidden">
      <div class="absolute -right-10 -bottom-10 w-72 h-72 bg-brand-mint/5 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>

      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-8 items-center">
        <div class="w-16 h-16 rounded-2xl bg-brand-mint/15 text-brand-mint flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[36px]">format_quote</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex-1">
          <blockquote class="text-base sm:text-lg text-on-surface italic leading-relaxed mb-6 font-sans">
            "Con el sistema anterior, cuando se caía el internet un sábado a las 6 de la tarde con el local repleto, las cajas se bloqueaban y las filas salían a la calle. Con InteliMarket, las cajeras ni se enteran si se cortó la red: siguen pesando en balanza, cobrando en Guaraníes o Reales y emitiendo tickets. Al cerrar el turno, el arqueo cuadra sin sorpresas."
          </blockquote>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between flex-wrap gap-4 pt-4 border-t border-outline-variant/20">
            <div>
              <span class="font-headline text-sm font-bold text-on-surface block">
                Gerencia de Operaciones
              </span>
              <span class="text-xs text-on-surface-variant">
                Cadena Mayorista & Supermercado en Frontera
              </span>
            </div>
            <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-brand-mint/10 text-brand-mint text-xs font-mono font-bold">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]">check_circle</span> Caso de éxito verificado
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
